join Amos (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
join Lebo (Neutral) left
Lebo: See, a latch is the whole thing. You can build a beautiful pen and if the latch is rubbish then it's a fence with an opinion.
Lebo: This one's off a gate at the old co-op building, and I've had it — Amos, how long have I had this latch?
Amos: Long time.
Lebo: Long time! There you go. Long time.
Lebo: Hah — listen to that. That's a proper noise, that is.
Amos: Mm.
- Is it good?
	Hope: Is it good?
	Amos: It's good.
[signal arg="hearts:amos:1"]
